Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Remap left Win key (scancode E0 5B) → left Ctrl (scancode 00 1D)
; Apply: dobbeltklikk og godta UAC. Logg ut og inn (eller restart) for at det skal verke.
; Reverser: køyr LWin_to_LCtrl_REMOVE.reg.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Keyboard Layout]
"Scancode Map"=hex:00,00,00,00,00,00,00,00,02,00,00,00,1d,00,5b,e0,00,00,00,00
